<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quaker Oats raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quaker Oats raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Quaker Oats Co to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Quaker Oats gained 1-5/8 to 43-3/4.</p>
